  "content": "<h1>標題微調</h1>\n<p>Minecraft 的標題一直不夠理想，存在多個問題且容易分散注意力。標題微調模組改善了標題的外觀並允許自定義，同時修復了許多長期存在的問題，例如標題超出螢幕範圍或卡在螢幕上。</p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>禁用標題</li>\n<li>標題縮放</li>\n<li>自動縮放標題</li>\n<li>標題透明度</li>\n<li>移除標題文字陰影</li>\n<li>斷開連接時清除</li>\n</ul>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmicrocontrollers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fMicrocontrollersDev%252fTitleTweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"codeberg\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/codeberg_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftitletweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n</a>",
